Lepton: build iHD with Android 14's clang

AOSP 14 turns clang's pragma-pack warnings into errors
(-Werror=pragma-pack-suspicious-include); gmmlib's headers deliberately
include others under #pragma pack, so every iHD file using them failed.
Turn the two warnings off for the driver.

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -40,6 +40,9 @@
     "-fcheck-new",
     "-Werror",
     "-Wno-unknown-pragmas",
+    // Lepton: AOSP 14 makes these errors; gmmlib packs its structs on purpose.
+    "-Wno-pragma-pack",
+    "-Wno-pragma-pack-suspicious-include",
     "-Wno-comments",
     "-Wno-attributes",
     "-Wno-narrowing",
